{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>01. Social Activities</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/72f2e4164364655.63f62fd0bda18.gif?t=1749712881\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/c734c479-1ede-48d8-a41b-47d6b383c7fc.gif?t=1749712881\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collaborate with friends to complete missions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your room with furniture and wallpapers, visit your friends' rooms, and use the messaging feature to send notes and stay connected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>02.\u00a0Match-Based Mini-Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/838e0b64-b731-4eaa-bea0.gif?t=1749712881\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d0c1d7ec-6e27-41ef-9545-0eb6a424ca77.gif?t=1749712881\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/01_7-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749712881\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in real-time across a variety of match-based game modes, including Team Deathmatch, Battle Royale, Capture the Flag, Hide &amp; Seek, Soccer, and Obstacle Races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 12 game modes currently available, more are being added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">03.\u00a0<strong>Character Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/222211.png?t=1749712881\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/11e6c5f58e-fb88-48f9-96fb-c59c4339d739.gif?t=1749712881\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your unique character with over 1,000 parts, emotes, and actions\u2014including tops, bottoms, hairstyles, hats, shoes, weapon skins, pets, and expressive emotes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your personal style and make your character truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728650?t=1749712881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/3ad136146d3b7b8cd2c267b6ddf1fa78972a13fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749712881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/84f5e7de308be32905f99bd39d38654a36b832c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749712881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/84f5e7de308be32905f99bd39d38654a36b832c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749712881","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>01. Social Activities</strong><br> </p><p class